    "short_description": "It's not what you say, it's how you say it. We should talk is a short-form narrative game that will make you think carefully about the words you choose. Can your relationship survive the night?",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cThis indie game has a brilliant modular dialogue system.\u201d<br>PCGamer<br><br>\u201cAlthough the range of options can sometimes seem only subtly different, it is this subtlety that makes the game brilliant.\u201d<br>Game Rant<br><br>\u201cIts reply-construction adds meaningful and thoughtful pause to a mechanic which is normally rushed through in other VN games, and here\u2019s hoping that it will be adapted to future examples in the genre.\u201d<br>Screen Rant<br>",
